 577: **This item is SLICED. The code gate runs twice, once per slice.** The reason is size measured
 578: rather than felt: five acceptance ids, ten test bodies, a new shipped module, a migration carrying
 579: the tree's first policy set, three edge functions, two adapters and two conformance arms. One diff
 580: review over all of that would return a wall of findings in which the important ones are
